<title>CANADA: Canada's Prairies to see sunny skies.</title>
<headline>Canada's Prairies to see sunny skies.</headline>
<dateline>WINNIPEG 1997-07-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Canada's Prairies on Monday were forecast to see sunny skies, Environment Canada said.</p>
<p>Alberta should see sunny skies with highs of 25 to 28 Celsius.</p>
<p>Saskatchewan should see mainly sunny skies with highs of 24 to 28 Celsius.</p>
<p>Manitoba should see mainly sunny skies with highs of 23 to 25 Celsius.</p>
<p>((Gilbert Le Gras, Winnipeg Reuters bureau 204 947 3548))</p>
